# Tolsimir, Midnight's Light: when it enters it makes Voja Fenstalker, a legendary 5/5 green and white Wolf with trample (the token has
# summoning sickness, as Tolsimir does). On turn 3 both attack, Voja listed first: "Whenever a Wolf you control attacks, if Tolsimir
# attacked this combat" holds although they are declared together (CR 508.1k), so the Wolf's trigger targets the one creature an
# opponent controls, Bot2's Barbary Apes, which must block Voja (CR 509.1c): not Tolsimir, and not nothing. The Apes (2/2) die to the 5/5,
# which tramples 3 over (CR 702.19b); Tolsimir is unblocked and gains 3 life.

